A new Library has been created in Salesforce. Please create 2 corresponding dynamic lists in Pardot - one for Individual Emails, one for Summary Emails. 

{!Library__c.Name}
{!Library__c.Link}

In Pardot, go to Marketing->Segmentation->Lists and create a new list. Choose for it to be dynamic. The name of the List and the name of the SF Library must match exactly.  Criteria for the dynamic list (match all):
* Prospect CRM Library is {!Library__c.Name}
* Prospect account field Status is Enabled
* Status is 'Enabled'
* 'Opted Out' isn't '1'